        <div class="col-12 col-md-6 content" data-mh="block-1">
                            <h2 class="mb-3">What is a Maize Maze?</h2>
                        <p class="lead">Well to start with let&#39;s find out what is MAIZE?</p>

<p>Dictionary definition; maize noun 1 a tall cereal plant belonging to the grass family, widely grown for its edible yellow grain which grows in large spikes called corncobs. 2 the grain of this plant, eaten ripe and unripe as a vegetable (sweetcorn) and used as a source of oil, flour, starch and syrup. Also called corn (sense 2), Indian corn. See also mealie.</p>

    <a class="btn btn-default d-block d-lg-inline-block mt-2 px-lg-5" href="https://www.maize-maze.com/about-us" target="_self"> See More Information</a>
        </div>
