    <div class="col-12 col-md-6 content" data-mh="block-2">
                    <h2 class="mb-3">Make it Social</h2>
                <p><meta charset="utf-8" />Keep up to date with what&#39;s going on in the world of Maize Mazes and share your experiences by liking the Maize Maze Association Facebook page and following the Maize Maze Association on Twitter.<br />
<br />
Take a photo of your maize maze day out and send it to us. Visit the Gallery page for details.</p>

